		<label>santa sack</label>
		<description>무한한 깊이감을 갖는 산타의 보따리에는 끝없는 물건이 들어갑니다.</description>
		<graphicData>
			<texPath>Thing/Apparel/RK_TextureApparel_SantaSack</texPath>
			<graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
			<shaderType>CutoutComplex</shaderType>
		</graphicData>
		<statBases>
			<MaxHitPoints>150</MaxHitPoints>
